  "body": "Bookmarks headings were fixed at 11px, and the existing \u201cHide title\u201d setting only affected individual bookmark names. Add a \u201cShow widget title\u201d toggle and an 8\u201332px heading-size slider. Existing widgets retain the visible 11px heading; hiding it preserves its text, and the bookmark layout accounts for the selected heading size. Rename the existing English label to \u201cHide bookmark names\u201d to distinguish the controls.\n\nImplements [the reported request](https://github.com/homarr-labs/homarr/issues/6600#issuecomment-5707167747) and [the proposed controls](https://github.com/homarr-labs/homarr/issues/6600#issuecomment-5708805969).\n\nValidation: focused oxfmt and oxlint checks, translation JSON parsing, and `git diff --check` passed. Manually exercised the real Bookmarks component, option definitions, switch and slider inputs in an isolated browser fixture with mocked app data: 8px/32px bounds, heading hide/restore, preserved title text, and independent bookmark-name visibility. Full dashboard integration, typecheck, build and automated tests were not run.\n\n- [x] Relevant focused formatting and lint checks pass\n- [x] Branch starts from `release/v2` (`60b4e980e`) and targets `release/v2`\n- [x] Conventional commit and repository code style\n- [x] Matching documentation updates under `apps/docs`\n- [x] No temporary browser fixture files checked in\n",
